## Metro (React Native bundler) walks node_modules expecting a flat layout.
## pnpm's default symlink-based isolation hides transitive deps from that
## walk, so Metro fails to resolve things like @react-navigation/native that
## are actually pulled in by expo-router.
##
## node-linker=hoisted gives us a flatter, npm-style node_modules tree that
## Metro is happy with. We pay a bit of disk and lose strict isolation, but
## that's the right call for a React Native + pnpm monorepo.
node-linker=hoisted
